08:15:50.130 > l
08:15:50.199 | Shunai Bridge. (road)
08:15:50.200 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Nature's fecundity floods the surrounds with the clamour of life in a chittering refrain. The stars glimmer down, broken only upon occasion by thin wisps of clouds. A marvel of engineering second only to the road which it supports, the great Shunai Bridge crosses the restless waters of the Urubamba, providing safe passage for all travellers. Made of massive stone pylons and rare, nearly indestructible woods, only those master builders, Dwarves, could have crafted such a structure. The view from this moderate elevation shows the river cutting south through marsh and grass before it curves in the distance to water portions of the Black Forest and more remote places. Somewhere far to the north, past any hope of seeing, is the river's source, the humble beginnings of one of the great rivers that flow across Sapience. A logosmas stocking has been hung here, awaiting gifts. A sigil in the shape of a small, rectangular monolith is on the ground. A vicious death adder is here, hood flared in warning. There are 2 black-crowned nycticoraxes here. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. The twisted remains of Xylarys lie here. Gavai, the Jamala is here, hidden. His features are obscured by Revelation's Guise. He wields Elentari's Scourge in his left hand and a Shield of Absorption in his right. Slave Morasla, Pestilent Disciple is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by a darkened mask dripping with gold. She wields Adchachel's lament in her right hand. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Truthseeker Vasyly is here. He wields Reaver, a dark brass morningstar in his left hand and Sentinel, a darkened-silver morningstar in his right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a Braincrusher flail in each hand. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand. Tomekeeper Harkon d'Ivoire, Scourge of His Legion is here. He wields a leaf-bladed ritual knife in his left hand.
08:15:50.200 | You see exits leading east and west.
