08:17:59.774 | Path over mountains. (road)
08:17:59.774 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. The stars glimmer down from a clear and cloudless sky, bathing the landscape in silvery light. Precarious and serpentine, this path runs around the circumference of the base of the mountain, winding slowly into the lofty heights where the air is crisp and rarified. Though the elevation is still relatively low compared to the mountain tops, there is a clear drop in temperature as the cold northern air rushes from the mountains. A large cart rests here, stacked high with assorted containers secured with thick rope. There are 2 black-crowned nycticoraxes here. Slave Morasla, Pestilent Disciple is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by a darkened mask dripping with gold. She wields Adchachel's lament in her right hand. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Truthseeker Vasyly is here. He wields Reaver, a dark brass morningstar in his left hand and Sentinel, a darkened-silver morningstar in his right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a Braincrusher flail in each hand. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand. Tomekeeper Harkon d'Ivoire, Scourge of His Legion is here. He wields a leaf-bladed ritual knife in his left hand.
08:17:59.774 | You see exits leading up and down.
