08:19:01.789 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. A poisonous black mist blankets the ground. Sand has covered the location. The stars glimmer down from a clear and cloudless sky, bathing the landscape in silvery light. As you climb among the canyon and rising mountain peaks, the roar of a waterfall becomes faintly audible, adding to the melody of the howling wind among these rocky heights. The sound seems to come from the west a little more down the path, yet, you can't see them due to a large tree that has fallen across the path and your view. Luckily, there is the faint resemblance of a trail to the northwest that appears to lead around the fallen tree. A rune shaped like a butterfly has been sketched into the ground here. A rune like an open eye has been sketched into the ground here. A rune like a rising sun has been sketched into the ground here. A sigil in the shape of a small, rectangular monolith is on the ground. A large cart rests here, stacked high with assorted containers secured with thick rope. There are 2 black-crowned nycticoraxes here. There are 2 swarms of bees here. A mottled Mhojave Desert falcon glides effortlessly to and fro. A vicious death adder is here, hood flared in warning. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. The twisted remains of Grulk lie here. Slave Morasla, Pestilent Disciple is here. Her features are obscured by a darkened mask dripping with gold. She wields Gattan'lier's hunger in her left hand and Adchachel's lament in her right. She is surrounded by one reflection of herself. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Truthseeker Vasyly is here. He wields Reaver, a dark brass morningstar in his left hand and Sentinel, a darkened-silver morningstar in his right. Tendril Froedine, of the Heather Plant is here, vines undulating about her form. Commodore Lauryyn Distara, Seeker of Opulence is here. Her face is partially concealed beneath the raised hood of an ornate gold-embellished stola. She wields a wyvern-etched druidic quarterstaff in both hands. Kushy Ebonheart, Quester of the Mountain Grizzly is here. He wields a wyvern-etched druidic quarterstaff in both hands. Uaithne Boulden, of Eleusis is here. His face is partially concealed beneath the raised hood of a hooded, sealskin cloak. He wields a Scimitar of Falcons in each hand. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a Braincrusher flail in each hand. Gladespear Averine Stormwing is here. She is juggling a curved dagger, a curved dagger, and a curved dagger. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand. Tomekeeper Harkon d'Ivoire, Scourge of His Legion is here. He wields a leaf-bladed ritual knife in his left hand.
