08:20:12.537 | A pass over the mountains. (road)
08:20:12.538 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. Sand has covered the location. The stars glimmer down from a clear and cloudless sky, bathing the landscape in silvery light. As you climb among the canyon and rising mountain peaks, the roar of a waterfall becomes faintly audible, adding to the melody of the howling wind among these rocky heights. The sound seems to come from the west a little more down the path, yet, you can't see them due to a large tree that has fallen across the path and your view. Luckily, there is the faint resemblance of a trail to the northwest that appears to lead around the fallen tree. A rune like a rising sun has been sketched into the ground here. A sigil in the shape of a small, rectangular monolith is on the ground. There are 2 black-crowned nycticoraxes here. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. A swarm of bees hovers menacingly nearby. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. Golden glare fixated on movement, a fierce falcon screams overhead. A vicious death adder is here, hood flared in warning. The twisted remains of Xylarys lie here. Gavai, the Jamala is here, hidden. His features are obscured by Revelation's Guise. He wields Elentari's Scourge in his left hand and a Shield of Absorption in his right. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Truthseeker Vasyly is here. He wields Reaver, a dark brass morningstar in his left hand and Sentinel, a darkened-silver morningstar in his right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields Gattan'lier's hunger in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand. Tomekeeper Harkon d'Ivoire, Scourge of His Legion is here. He wields a leaf-bladed ritual knife in his left hand.
