08:20:53.172 | A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. Sand has covered the location. The stars glimmer down from a clear and cloudless sky, bathing the landscape in silvery light. As you climb among the canyon and rising mountain peaks, the roar of a waterfall becomes faintly audible, adding to the melody of the howling wind among these rocky heights. The sound seems to come from the west a little more down the path, yet, you can't see them due to a large tree that has fallen across the path and your view. Luckily, there is the faint resemblance of a trail to the northwest that appears to lead around the fallen tree. A rune like a rising sun has been sketched into the ground here. A sigil in the shape of a small, rectangular monolith is on the ground. Crimson eyes burn ardently beneath the black crown of feathers encircling the head of a giant nycticorax. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. A swarm of bees hovers menacingly nearby. A vicious death adder is here, hood flared in warning. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Truthseeker Vasyly is here. He wields Reaver, a dark brass morningstar in his left hand and Sentinel, a darkened-silver morningstar in his right.
