08:22:01.152 > l
08:22:01.248 | Passing the Black Forest. (road)
08:22:01.249 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Nature's fecundity floods the surrounds with the clamour of life in a chittering refrain. Pale radiance bathes the land, a subtle ripple in the celestial vault forming into a faded moonbow. The forest hovers a few steps beyond the road, gradually expanding on both sides to make this segment darker through leafy shade. The distinctive scent of pine and the more faint perfume of musty leaves and loam mix within the air as it whirls through this narrow jaunt. Leaves are scattered across the road along with rocks and the occasional bird, briefly daring out of the Black Forest to search for discarded food or sparkling treasures. Quite innocently, a banana peel lies on the ground. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand.
