08:22:19.547 | Passing the Black Forest. (road)
08:22:19.547 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Nature's fecundity floods the surrounds with the clamour of life in a chittering refrain. Pale radiance bathes the land, a subtle ripple in the celestial vault forming into a faded moonbow. The road, impressed upon the ground solely through footfall, winds alongside the Black Forest, walking close to the tree line yet still skilfully dodging the forest's ever widening embrace. Pine and oaks stand sentinel there, lichen and ferns congregating at their bases and slowly creeping toward the stone-lined edges of the road. An eastern path leads into the dark reaches of the wood, and the scent of mustiness and damp leaves wafts from it with every breeze. No such entrance is provided to the west, where taller trees create a green horizon and vines thoroughly tangle their appendages. Quite innocently, a banana peel lies on the ground. A large cart rests here, stacked high with assorted containers secured with thick rope. Inverted wings pointed skyward, Lethe, a great white bat considers her dominion. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. A vicious death adder is here, hood flared in warning. Golden glare fixated on movement, a fierce falcon screams overhead. Gavai, the Jamala is here, hidden. His features are obscured by Revelation's Guise. He wields a timeworn serpent's dirk in his left hand and a Shield of Absorption in his right. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields Gattan'lier's hunger in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand.
