08:25:43.976 | Before two towering mountains. (road)
08:25:43.977 | A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. An ominous crimson glow blankets this location as flames lick hungrily at the surroundings. The stars glimmer down, broken only upon occasion by thin wisps of clouds. Two towering mountains, their twisted peaks a dark penumbra against the miasmic sky, dominate this bleak terrain. Amidst boulders and crevasses filled with mist, a treacherous pathway winds between their twisted forms. The silhouette of Baelgrim Fortress looms upon the tallest precipice, its spires crowning the mountain isle like a diadem of ominous thorns. An occupied iron gibbet, suspended from a wooden gallows, creaks ominously in the breeze. A runic totem is planted solidly in the ground. A decaying corpse has been impaled here upon a fifteen foot stake. A large wall of stone stands here, blocking passage to the southwest. Exuding a most fearful atmosphere, a terrifying chimera ominously skulks about here. Crimson eyes burn ardently beneath the black crown of feathers encircling the head of a giant nycticorax. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. Golden glare fixated on movement, a fierce falcon screams overhead. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Truthseeker Vasyly is riding on a dreadful chimera. He wields Reaver, a dark brass morningstar in his left hand and Sentinel, a darkened-silver morningstar in his right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields Gattan'lier's hunger in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand.
