08:26:18.799 > l
08:26:18.847 | Crossing a peak in the mountains. (road)
08:26:18.848 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. The stars glimmer down from a clear and cloudless sky, bathing the landscape in silvery light. This is the smaller of the two peaks. While it is possible to see farther from the other, it is easier to see more from here, as this apex reaches out away from the mountains. There are also fewer trees here to block the view. The Bastion of the North is just barely visible from this vantage point and glimmers of light sparkle off the ocean to the west. The path to the west begins to go back down the mountain, while to the east, it continues to the higher crescent. Sparks surge along a huge anchor, its surface formed from swirling copper. Crimson eyes burn ardently beneath the black crown of feathers encircling the head of a giant nycticorax. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. A vicious death adder is here, hood flared in warning. Gavai, the Jamala is here, shrouded. His features are obscured by Revelation's Guise. He wields Elentari's Scourge in his left hand and a Shield of Absorption in his right. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a Braincrusher flail in each hand. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand.
