08:28:24.740 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. Dawn breaks across the land, the sky and its sparse clouds lit in fiery hues by the rising sun. Covered in a slippery, oily substance, a narrow stone road cuts across the blackened shoreline, leading from the ominously red ocean to the south toward the tall, desolate mountain that caps this dismal island. The rocky shoreline gives way farther inland to thick, jet-black sand, strangely viscous and glistening oddly in the light. A steady wind blows foam from the crashing waves northwards to spatter along the shore, but the gusts barely stir the surface of the sandy ground. Rotten clumps of algae, the colour of dried blood, adhere to the stones bordering the pathway. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. Steward Layta Lichlord, Red Reaper is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by an unsettling porcelain doll-face mask. She wields Agith'maal's ire in her left hand and a bone shield reinforced with blackened steel in her right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right.
